STM32CubeG5
###########

Origin:
   STMicroelectronics
   https://www.st.com/en/embedded-software/stm32cubeg5.html

Status:
   version 2.0.0

Purpose:
   STMicroelectronics official MCU package for STM32G5 series.

Description:
   This package is an extract of official STM32CubeG5 package written by STMicroelectronics.
   It is composed of STM32Cube hardware abstraction layer (HAL) and low layer (LL) plus a set
   of CMSIS headers files, one for each SoC in the STM32G5 series.

Dependencies:
    None.

URL:
   https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/STM32CubeG5

Commit:
   55256c5f5d7050ea2474fb006877c12bbdd09f4c

Maintained-by:
   External

License:
   BSD-3-Clause

License Link:
   https://opensource.org/licenses/BSD-3-Clause

Patch List:
   *Changes from official delivery:
    -dos2unix applied
    -trailing white spaces removed

   *Set value of USE_HAL_<ppp>_DMA macros to value of USE_HAL_DMA_MODULE to prevent
    DMA usage from HAL peripheral drivers when DMA support is disabled.

    Impacted files:
     stm32cube/stm32g5xx/drivers/templates/common/stm32g5xx_hal_conf.h

   See release_note.html from STM32Cube
